    "chunk_text": "On eallen Godes bebodan seo so\u00f0e lufe h\u00e6f\u00f0 \u00feone ealdordom, buten \u00fe\u00e6re fullfremednysse For Paulus se apostol \u00feuss cw\u00e6\u00f0, Ne martyrhad, ne \u00feysser wurlde forhogung, ne \u00e6lmesd\u00e6de, ne by\u00f0 Beo \u00fe\u00e6re eac ure Drihten fram sumen writere geascod w\u00e6s, hw\u00e6t w\u00e6re \u00fe\u00e6t m\u00e6ste bebod, & \u00feuss he & \u00fe\u00e6re eac to geehte & cw\u00e6\u00f0, O\u00f0er is \u00feyssen gelic, lufe \u00feinne nexte swa swa \u00fee sylfne, for \u00fean \u00fee on Witodlice \u00fea \u00fea he cw\u00e6\u00f0, Of eallre heorte & of eallre mihte, & of eallra sawle, & of eallen mode, \u00fe\u00e6t So\u00f0lice eall seo Godes lufe is on \u00fe\u00e6re gehealdnysse his beboden, swa swa he sylf cw\u00e6\u00f0 on o\u00f0re stowe, & eft he cw\u00e6\u00f0, on \u00fean oncnawe\u00f0 m\u00e6nn, \u00fe\u00e6t ge by\u00f0 mine \u00feeignes, gyf ge habbe\u00f0 so\u00f0e lufe betwux & eft se apostol cw\u00e6\u00f0, seo so\u00f0e lufe is fullnysse Godes \u00e6. & Johannes se godspellere cw\u00e6\u00f0, \u00feiss bebod we habbe\u00f0 fram Gode, \u00fe\u00e6t se \u00fee God lufige, he eac lufige Gyf \u00feone hwylc man axige, hwa beo his nexte, \u00feonne wyte he swy\u00f0e rihtlice \u00e6lcne Cristene mann beon So\u00f0lice \u00e6\u00f0elre is seo gastlice gebyrd, \u00feone se fl\u00e6sclice. Beo \u00fe\u00e6re ure Drihten cw\u00e6\u00f0, Bute hwa seo eft ac\u00e6nnod of w\u00e6tere & of \u00fean halgen gaste, ne m\u00e6ig he",
